{"id":"619194","name":"烙饼","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/619194/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"450g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"3g"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"3g"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"20g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"15g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"225g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主料和辅料放入面包机容器中。","img":"images/619194/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"按揉面程序。","img":"images/619194/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉好的面团。","img":"images/619194/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉好的面团放入容器中，盖上保鲜膜，发酵一小时。","img":"images/619194/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发好的面揉出气体，分成两半。","img":"images/619194/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把面团擀成长方形片。","img":"images/619194/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"猪油适量，蒸融。","img":"images/619194/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"很快就融化了。","img":"images/619194/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面片抹上猪油。","img":"images/619194/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"卷起来，抻长。","img":"images/619194/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切成六份。","img":"images/619194/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成薄饼。","img":"images/619194/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"平底锅预热，放入饼胚。小火烙，无需加油。","img":"images/619194/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"常翻面。","img":"images/619194/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"大概十分钟就烙好了。","img":"images/619194/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/619194/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}